				<h3 class="conH3 top">Waterworks Authority</h3>
<p class="indnet margin_b_20">For inquiries on water leaks, water rates, change of billing information, and water quality inspection</p>
<div class="mCont_scroll">
  <table class="contTable_c">
    <caption>
    information about the Office of Waterworks Help Desk Information
    </caption>
    <colgroup>
    <col style="width:25%">
    <col/>
    <col style="width:23%">
    <col style="width:17%">
    </colgroup>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">Office</th>
        <th scope="col">Location</th>
        <th scope="col">Areas Covered</th>
        <th scope="col">Tel</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Jungbu Water Supply Office</td>
        <td>88 Jangchungdanno, Jung-gu, Seoul<br>(208-1 Jangchung-dong 2-ga)</td>
        <td>Jongno, Junggu, Yongsan, Seongbuk</td>
        <td>+82-2-3146-2000</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Seobu Water Supply Office</td>
        <td>41 Tongil-ro 26-gil, Seodaemun-gu, Seoul<br>(38-69 Hongje-dong)</td>
        <td>Eunpyeong, Seodaemun, Mapo</td>
        <td>+82-2-3146-3500</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Dongbu Water Supply Office</td>
        <td>13 Gosanja-ro 10-gil, Seongdong-gu, Seoul<br>(142-1 Haengdang 1-dong)</td>
        <td>Seongdong, Gwangjin, Jungnang, Dongdaemun </td>
        <td>+82-2-3146-2600</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Bukbu Water Supply Office</td>
        <td>935 Hancheon-ro, Gangbuk-gu, Seoul<br>(377 Beon-dong)</td>
        <td>Nowon, Gangbuk, Dobong</td>
        <td>+82-2-3146-3200</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Gangseo Water Supply Office</td>
        <td>155 Dong-ro, Mok-dong, Yangcheon-gu, Seoul(319-15 Sinjeong-dong)</td>
        <td>Yangcheon, Gangseo, Guro </td>
        <td>+82-2-3146-3800</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Nambu Water Supply Office</td>
