<h3 class="conH3">Dial 120 for inquiries on waterworks</h3>
<p class="indnet">For all inquiries on waterworks such as water supply cutoff, water leak, water pipe freezing, or water rates, dial 120 to be connected to the Seoul Dasan Call Center. When using a mobile phone or for long-distance calls, dial +82-2-120.</p>
